Z||000000||Earne||03-07-2000||08:19 AM||||Sorry about the dust and fingerprints, I haven't had time to do much cleaning after putting it back together.<P> <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=103583&a=2238074&p=17450844&Sequence=6" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=103583&a=2238074&p=17450844&Sequence=6</A> <P> <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=103583&a=2238074&p=17431700&Sequence=2" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=103583&a=2238074&p=17431700&Sequence=2</A>     <P> <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=103583&a=2238074&p=17431694&Sequence=2" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=103583&a=2238074&p=17431694&Sequence=2</A>   <P>Did you notice my trunk light replacement, I patched in some carpet in the old location and added this early 90's Pontiac option.<P> <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=103583&a=2238074&p=17431695&Sequence=2" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=103583&a=2238074&p=17431695&Sequence=2</A>   <P> <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=103583&a=2238074&p=17431698&Sequence=2" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=103583&a=2238074&p=17431698&Sequence=2</A>   <P>The cord is about 4 feet long and the back of the light is magnetic.<P>Here is a shot of Pisa's replacement dash in Charcoal leather.<P> <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=103583&a=2238074&p=17431705&Sequence=2" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=103583&a=2238074&p=17431705&Sequence=2</A>    <P>A few exterior shots just 'cause I'm proud of it.<P> <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=103583&a=2238074&p=17431707&Sequence=3" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=103583&a=2238074&p=17431707&Sequence=3</A> <P> <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=103583&a=2238074&p=17431709&Sequence=2" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=103583&a=2238074&p=17431709&Sequence=2</A> <P> <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=103583&a=2238074&p=17431712&Sequence=2" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=103583&a=2238074&p=17431712&Sequence=2</A> <P> <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=103583&a=2238074&p=17431713&Sequence=2" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=103583&a=2238074&p=17431713&Sequence=2</A> <P> <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=103583&a=2238074&p=17431714&Sequence=3" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=103583&a=2238074&p=17431714&Sequence=3</A>  <P>Well, what do you think? I'm ready for the thumbs down or thumbs up comments. Did you notice my leather cobra head Grand Prix  shift knob? Two minute replacement and it looks great. There is also a 1999 seven channel equalizer, Grand Prix CD player with red backlighting (one of few pontiac still makes that way). Last but not least, picture my Toy with T-Tops. A brand spakin' new set are getting installed next month. They even came with the rivets, locks and keys. Hope you like it, thanks for asking.<P>I gave up on the images, here are the links.||||reg||1
